    "instructions": "Use search_book to identify a book, get_book_dna to break it into tropes, setting, subgenre, tone and storyline, recommend for one shelf of books like a given book, and recommend_by_tropes when the reader names tropes rather than a book. Every recommended book has been verified to exist on Open Library.",
